      <![CDATA[<h1 id="ssh私钥泄露靶场"><a href="#ssh私钥泄露靶场" class="headerlink" title="ssh私钥泄露靶场"></a>ssh私钥泄露靶场</h1><h2 id="云盘下载靶场"><a href="#云盘下载靶场" class="headerlink" title="云盘下载靶场"></a>云盘下载靶场</h2><p><a href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/14Gh7qsFAncBY4g11xHJRhw">https://pan.baidu.com/s/14Gh7qsFAncBY4g11xHJRhw</a>   提取码：asdf</p><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260909200647601.png" alt="image-20260909200647601"></p><p>必须改成NAT，不然扫不到ip</p><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260909200727932.png" alt="image-20260909200727932"></p><p>导入虚拟机，发现登陆不了</p><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260909200754625.png" alt="image-20260909200754625"></p><p>测试同网段ip：</p><pre><code>netdiscover -r 192.168.95.0/24</code></pre><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260908225955042.png" alt="image-20260908225955042"></p><p>ssh虚拟机ip是192.168.95.128 </p><h3 id="nmap"><a href="#nmap" class="headerlink" title="nmap"></a>nmap</h3><p>利用nmap端口扫描工具，-sV：对开放端口做探测，识别端口上运行的软件 + 版本号</p><pre><code>nmap -sV 192.168.95.128</code></pre><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260908230432794.png" alt="image-20260908230432794"></p><p>开放了80和31337两个端口，先看一下80端口： </p><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260908230658740.png" alt="image-20260908230658740"></p><p> 31337端口</p><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260908230658740.png" alt="image-20260908230658740"></p><p>都没有用的信息。 </p><p>dirsearch扫目录：</p><pre><code>dirsearch -u &quot;http://192.168.95.128:31337/&quot;</code></pre><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260908231542953.png" alt="image-20260908231542953"></p><p>访问 &#x2F;.ssh</p><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260908231706699.png" alt="image-20260908231706699"></p><h3 id="私钥与公钥"><a href="#私钥与公钥" class="headerlink" title="私钥与公钥"></a>私钥与公钥</h3><p>id_rsa：私钥<br>id_rsa.pub：公钥<br>authorized_keys：数字签名</p><p>访问公钥192.168.95.128:31337&#x2F;.ssh&#x2F;id_rsa.pub自动下载了，在终端打开：</p><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260908232421371.png" alt="image-20260908232421371"></p><p>ssh-rsa 【一大串公钥加密字符串】 用户名@主机名</p><p>私钥的打开需要密码</p><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260908232800717.png" alt="image-20260908232800717"></p><h3 id="爆破"><a href="#爆破" class="headerlink" title="爆破"></a>爆破</h3><p>先解压字典：</p><pre><code>gunzip /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt.gz</code></pre><p>（把 .gz 压缩格式的密码字典解压为文本字典文件，供 john 工具调用。）</p><p>进行爆破：</p><pre><code>john --wordlist=/usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt --format=ssh rsacrack</code></pre><ul><li><code>--wordlist</code>：指定爆破使用的密码字典路径</li><li><code>--format=ssh</code>：指定待爆破哈希的类型为 SSH 私钥哈希</li><li><code>rsacrack</code>：由 ssh2john.py 输出得到的私钥哈希文件</li></ul><p>查看结果：</p><pre><code>john --show rsacrack</code></pre><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260908234430977.png" alt="image-20260908234430977"></p><p>私钥解密密码  id_rsa:starwars</p><p>尝试登陆：</p><pre><code>ssh -i id_rsa simon@192.168.95.128</code></pre><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260908234837994.png" alt="image-20260908234837994"></p><p>失败原因：私钥文件权限不能对外开放，现在 id_rsa 权限是 644，其他用户可读，SSH 直接拒绝加载这个私钥，忽略文件，登录失败。 </p><p>仅允许所有者读写：</p><pre><code>chmod 600 id_rsa</code></pre><p>再次登录：</p><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260908235229128.png" alt="image-20260908235229128"></p><p>切到&#x2F;root发现有俩文件，flag.txt受权限限制只有 root 用户能读。当前用户是 simon，读取另一个文件发现flag：</p><p><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/qqq911-qqq/img/img/image-20260909000049948.png" alt="image-20260909000049948"></p>]]>
